From 6b27ae6e20e349e80839e4796378dcb6f6e712a8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tolon <tolon@tolunet.local>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 12:31:45 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] m68k: combine-clr peephole2 must not merge zero stores of
 different modes

The peephole2 commented "combine clr if possible" merges #0 stores at
x and x+size into one wider store, but checked the mode (and volatility)
of the first store only; both mems in the pattern are mode-less.

- .w #0,x + .l #0,x+2 became clr.l x: the long's low word was never
  cleared (68000/68020/68080, -O2 and -Os)
- a volatile second store was merged as well
- -m68080: .l #0,x + .w #0,x+4 became clr.q x, writing 8 bytes for 6

Require the second store to have the same mode as the first and not be
volatile. Same-mode merges (.w+.w -> clr.l, -m68080 .l+.l -> clr.q) are
unchanged.
---
 gcc/config/m68k/m68k.md | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/gcc/config/m68k/m68k.md b/gcc/config/m68k/m68k.md
index ba83ff41af..111b4de62e 100644
--- a/gcc/config/m68k/m68k.md
+++ b/gcc/config/m68k/m68k.md
@@ -9179,6 +9179,9 @@
    		(match_dup 1))
    ]
   "(operands[4] = SET_DEST(PATTERN(insn))) && 
+  (operands[6] = SET_DEST(PATTERN(peep2_next_insn(1)))) && 
+  GET_MODE(operands[6]) == GET_MODE(operands[4]) && 
+  !operands[6]->volatil && 
   (TARGET_68080 || GET_MODE_SIZE(GET_MODE(operands[4])) == 2) && 
   current_pass->static_pass_number >= 2 && 
    0 == INTVAL (operands[1]) && 
-- 
2.43.0

